<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>{{> layout/head-meta}}<title>좋아요한 행사 | Busan Play</title>{{> layout/favorite-assets}}</head>
<body>
{{> layout/header}}
{{> layout/account-style}}
<main class="favorites-page"><div class="account-layout">
    {{> layout/account-nav}}
    <section class="account-content" data-favorites-page>
        <span class="member-eyebrow">BUSAN PLAY · MY PAGE</span><h1>좋아요한 행사</h1>
        <p class="favorites-description">관심 있는 행사를 모았습니다. 하트를 다시 누르면 목록에서 제외됩니다.</p>
        <p class="favorites-description" role="status">좋아요한 행사 <strong data-favorite-total>{{favoriteTotal}}</strong>개</p>
        {{#favorites}}{{#event}}
        <article class="favorite-item" data-favorite-item>
            {{#categoryName}}<span class="favorites-description">{{categoryName}}</span>{{/categoryName}}
            <h2><a href="/event/{{id}}">{{title}}</a></h2>
            <p class="favorites-description">{{summary}}</p>
            <p class="favorites-description" data-favorite-event-status>{{status}}</p>
            {{> layout/favorite-button}}
        </article>
        {{/event}}{{/favorites}}
        <div class="favorites-empty" data-favorites-empty {{#hasFavorites}}hidden{{/hasFavorites}}>
            <h2>좋아요한 행사가 없습니다.</h2><p class="favorites-description">행사 카드의 하트를 눌러 관심 있는 행사를 모아보세요.</p><a href="/events/list">행사 둘러보기 →</a>
        </div>
        <noscript><p class="favorites-description">좋아요를 변경하려면 JavaScript를 활성화해 주세요.</p></noscript>
    </section>
</div></main>
{{> layout/footer}}
</body></html>
